SUMMARY:Run for the Reef\, 18th year
DESCRIPTION:A 10K\, a 5K run and walk\, and a one mile fun run for ages tw
 elve and under\, all starting from the pier at Navarre Beach. The 5K and 
 10K run out and back along Gulf Blvd\, and the fun run goes off on the Se
 a Turtle Center nature trail once the 5K has cleared. The money pays for 
 the Navarre Beach Marine Sanctuary's snorkelling and diving reefs\, so th
 e race is literally funding the thing it is named after. There is an afte
 r race party with food and refreshments.\nPrice: not published by the ven
 ue\, so confirm before you go\nArea: Gulf Breeze & Navarre\nTimes: Saturd
 ay 10/10 · 7:30 AM\nhttps://coastaleventures.com/events/ev-18th-annual-r
 un-for-the-reef-1010.html
